							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							But what if Test does an item wipe... oh... next year?&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm24.gif" alt="cwm24" border="0" />
