	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15114"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b>Eelyen</b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guest<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								<a href="mailto:"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15114#msg15114"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15114#msg15114">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2313 on:</b> February 25, 2005, 11:46:58 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I don&#039;t see what my EQ2 doings has any importance here.  But whether it was entertaining to you or not is beyond my concern.  It got the message I wanted across.  And I have a great group of people now.  <br /><br />Don&#039;t tell me after a year, that people would still have any great interest in what I&#039;m doing with my game time?<br /><br />So just leave me be.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">But what if Test does an item wipe... oh... next year?</div><br />Tough luck?<br /><br />Edit:  I removed the post but left the link.  So if you still wish to read the updated version you&#039;ll have to visit my own boards and register an account.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: February 25, 2005, 12:20:34 pm by Eelyen</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15117"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
